
; *** United Forces TopUpDn Formats Configuration ***

; here is the format for the left column (top uploaders)
;         <num>  <name> <megs>
"\c1許c3  %2d.  %-20s %6ldM  "

; here is the format for the right column (top downloaders)
"     %-20s %6ldM   \c1許c3"

; here is the format for an empty left column (no uploader in chart)
"\c1許c3  %2d.                                "

; here is the format for an empty right column (no downloader in chart)
"                                    \c1許c3"
